{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2071","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2071"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Metadata convention for image / video / audio inputs to media generation.\nCarried on "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ImagePart.metadata"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"VideoPart.metadata"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AudioPart.metadata"},{"type":"text","value":"\nwhen used as conditioning inputs to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"generateImage()"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"generateVideo()"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"role","children":[{"type":"text","value":"role?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional role?: MediaInputRole;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2073","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2073"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional role hint disambiguating the part's intent for the adapter"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tag","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tag?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional tag?: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2082","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2082"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional user-defined label for this input (e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'woman-in-red-dress'"},{"type":"text","value":").\n"},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Informational only"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — adapters never read it and the SDK never\nrewrites prompt text based on it. Use it to correlate parts with the\nreferences you write in your prompt using the provider's own syntax\n(fal's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@Image1"},{"type":"text","value":", OpenAI's \"image 1\", etc.), or for your own\nbookkeeping/logging."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"role","text":"role?","level":3},{"id":"tag","text":"tag?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2071](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2071)\n\nMetadata convention for image / video / audio inputs to media generation.\nCarried on `ImagePart.metadata` / `VideoPart.metadata` / `AudioPart.metadata`\nwhen used as conditioning inputs to `generateImage()` or `generateVideo()`.\n\n## Properties\n\n### role?\n\n```ts\noptional role?: MediaInputRole;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2073](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2073)\n\nOptional role hint disambiguating the part's intent for the adapter\n\n***\n\n### tag?\n\n```ts\noptional tag?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2082](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2082)\n\nOptional user-defined label for this input (e.g. `'woman-in-red-dress'`).\n**Informational only** — adapters never read it and the SDK never\nrewrites prompt text based on it. Use it to correlate parts with the\nreferences you write in your prompt using the provider's own syntax\n(fal's `@Image1`, OpenAI's \"image 1\", etc.), or for your own\nbookkeeping/logging.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: MediaInputMetadata\ntitle: MediaInputMetadata\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2071](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2071)\n\nMetadata convention for image / video / audio inputs to media generation.\nCarried on `ImagePart.metadata` / `VideoPart.metadata` / `AudioPart.metadata`\nwhen used as conditioning inputs to `generateImage()` or `generateVideo()`.\n\n## Properties\n\n### role?\n\n```ts\noptional role?: MediaInputRole;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2073](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2073)\n\nOptional role hint disambiguating the part's intent for the adapter\n\n***\n\n### tag?\n\n```ts\noptional tag?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2082](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2082)\n\nOptional user-defined label for this input (e.g. `'woman-in-red-dress'`).\n**Informational only** — adapters never read it and the SDK never\nrewrites prompt text based on it. Use it to correlate parts with the\nreferences you write in your prompt using the provider's own syntax\n(fal's `@Image1`, OpenAI's \"image 1\", etc.), or for your own\nbookkeeping/logging.\n"}
